\prod_{l=0}^{n-1} \|f_l\|_{2n},\]</div> where for \(n=2\), \(C_{\href{nct-node:thm%3Aergodicthm}{1.2},2,r}=C_{\href{nct-node:thm%3AergodicthmJ}{2.7},2}^{1/2}\), and, for \(n\ge3\), \(C_{\href{nct-node:thm%3Aergodicthm}{1.2},n,r}=2^{1-2^{1-n}}\left(\tfrac{r}{r-2^{n-1}}\right)^{1/r}C_{\href{nct-node:thm%3AergodicthmJ}{2.7},n}^{1/2}\).

